ons\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Locations</a>\n                <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Contact</a>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"lg:hidden text-2xl\"><i class=\"fas fa-bars\"></i></button>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n    <section class=\"hero-gradient h-[600px] flex items-center text-white relative\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-4 leading-tight\">\n                Premium <span class=\"text-yellow-400\">Air Handling Unit services Kheda</span>\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 max-w-2xl\">\n                Atlas Aircon provides industrial-grade <b>AHU repair, maintenance, and AMC services</b> across Nadiad, Kheda, Matar, and all major industrial clusters in the district. Optimized cooling for all sectors.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"bg-[#25d366] hover:bg-green-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold flex items-center transition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                    <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp mr-2 text-2xl\"></i> Chat on WhatsApp\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold transition\">\n                    Call: +91 97272 57141\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- INTRODUCTION SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-justify\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">Expert <span class=\"text-blue-700\">Air Handling Unit services Kheda</span> for Modern Industrial Units</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mb-4 text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n                        Maintaining peak operational efficiency in Kheda&#8217;s growing industrial corridor requires high-precision <b>Air Handling Unit services Kheda</b>. At Atlas Aircon, we recognize that Kheda is a vital link between the industrial giants of Ahmedabad and Vadodara. From the processing units in Nadiad to the textile and engineering workshops in Matar and Mehmedabad, specialized HVAC care is essential to ensure production uptime.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-6\">\n                        An Air Handling Unit (AHU) functions as the lungs of your commercial or industrial facility. In Kheda&#8217;s environmental conditions, where humidity and dust can fluctuate significantly, these systems demand rigorous maintenance to prevent costly mechanical failures. Our comprehensive <b>Air Handling Unit services Kheda</b> cover every technical detail: from cooling coil restoration and HEPA filter management to precision motor rewinding. We service all configurations, including <b>Double Skin AHUs</b> for pharmaceutical grade cleanrooms and <b>Single Skin AHUs</b> for warehouse cooling.\n                    </p>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/ahu-manufacturers-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Air Handling Unit services Kheda\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-xl mb-6 w-full\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border-t-4 border-blue-600\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Why Kheda Industries Choose Atlas Aircon?</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Local Kheda Presence:</b> Quick response teams stationed near Nadiad and Mehmedabad for rapid on-site visits.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Sector-Specific Expertise:</b> Specialized cooling solutions for Food Processing, Textiles, and Engineering units.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Reliable AMC Plans:</b> Structured Annual Maintenance Contracts designed to minimize equipment downtime.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Certified Parts:</b> We use only genuine fan belts, motors, and high-quality filtration media.</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- BRANDS WE REPAIR -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Which Brands We Repair &#038; Service</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-10 text-gray-600\">We provide expert technical repair and maintenance for all leading AHU brands found across Kheda and Nadiad.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-8 items-center opacity-80\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Blue Star</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Daikin</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Carrier</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>York</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Zeco</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Edgetech</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Citizen</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Trane</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Voltas</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Hitachi</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Mitsubishi</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>LG</b></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- TYPES WE REPAIR -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-900 text-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center\">Types of AHU We Service in Kheda</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Floor Mounted Units</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Common in large warehouses and workshops in Kheda. We specialize in pulley alignment and blower cleaning.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-yellow-500 font-bold\">HVAC Solutions &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-green-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Ceiling Suspended AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Ideal for commercial showrooms in Nadiad. We handle drain line blockages and coil chemical washing.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"text-green-500 font-bold\">Showroom Cooling &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-blue-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Pharma/Food Grade AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Strict adherence to hygiene for Kheda&#8217;s processing units. Specialized in antimicrobial treatment and filter validation.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 font-bold\">Food Grade HVAC &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- INDUSTRIAL FOCUS SECTION (Kheda Specific) -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-gray-900\">Dedicated Service for Kheda GIDC &#038; Industrial Hubs</h2>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg\">\n                <p class=\"mb-6 text-lg text-justify\">\n                    Kheda is witnessing a rapid industrial transformation. Atlas Aircon offers specialized <b>Air Handling Unit services Kheda</b> tailored to meet the needs of diverse industrial estates. We provide rapid response teams for critical breakdowns and routine maintenance visits across the district.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-blue-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-industry mr-2\"></i> Major Industrial Clusters</h4>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Nadiad GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Matar Industrial Zone</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Kheda Industrial Estate</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Mehmedabad Clusters</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Kathlal Industrial Hub</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Mahudha Engineering Area</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Vaso Processing Belt</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-green-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt mr-2\"></i> Areas Served in Kheda</h4>\n                        <ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm\">\n                            <li>Nadiad</li>\n                            <li>Kheda City</li>\n                            <li>Mehmedabad</li>\n                            <li>Matar</li>\n                            <li>Dakor</li>\n                            <li>Kapadvanj</li>\n                            <li>Thasra</li>\n                            <li>Vaso</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PRICE TABLE -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">AHU Spare Parts &#038; Service Price List (Kheda Region)</h2>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white uppercase text-sm\">\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">AHU Maintenance Item / Service</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Approximate Cost</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Action</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Comprehensive AHU Deep Cleaning</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 1,500 &#8211; 4,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Book Service</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Pre-Filter</b> (Washable Mesh/Synthetic)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 450 &#8211; 1,500</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/shop\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Shop Parts</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>AHU Coil Restoration</b> (Chemical Washing)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 3,000 &#8211; 8,500</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Get Quote</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Blower Belt Set Replacement</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 800 &#8211; 2,200</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/fan-belts\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Buy Belts</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4 italic text-center\">* Pricing is indicative and varies based on AHU tonnage and specific location within Kheda district.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PROS AND CONS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Pros and Cons of Regular AHU Maintenance</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-green-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-800\">Advantages (Pros)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Lower Electricity Bills:</b> Clogged filters force fans to work harder; clean units save 20%+ power.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Extended System Life:</b> Regular lubrication prevents motor burnouts and bearing failures.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Process Reliability:</b> Critical for temperature-sensitive manufacturing in Kheda GIDCs.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Healthier Environment:</b> Removes 99% of airborne dust and pathogens from industrial air.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Better Air Distribution:</b> Balanced fans ensure uniform cooling across your entire facility.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Silent Operation:</b> Professional maintenance eliminates noisy blower vibrations.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Audit Readiness:</b> Helps processing plants clear safety and hygiene audits.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-red-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-800\">Risks of Neglect (Cons)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Unexpected Breakdowns:</b> Failure during peak summer can stop your entire production.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>High Emergency Costs:</b> Crisis repairs are significantly more expensive than planned AMC.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Odor &#038; Mold Issues:</b> Standing water in drain pans becomes a breeding ground for bacteria.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Uneven Cooling:</b> Blocked coils result in hot spots across the building.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Poor Air Hygiene:</b> Dirty filters re-circulate industrial dust back into the air.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Warranty Voidance:</b> Many manufacturers require service logs to honor hardware warranties.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Increased Carbon Footprint:</b> Inefficient units waste energy and increase CO2 emissions.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ERROR CODES -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Common AHU Error Codes &#038; Fixes</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">E1: Low Airflow</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Fix:</b> Replace clogged pre-filters. Check for fan belt slippage.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">E4: Coil Freeze</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Fix:</b> Check refrigerant levels. Ensure dampers are open for proper heat exchange.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">E7: Drain Overflow</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Fix:</b> Clear blockages in the &#8220;P&#8221; trap. Level the condensate drain pan.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">L2: Overload Trip</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Fix:</b> Verify motor voltage. Check for bearing friction in the blower assembly.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Kheda AHU Service FAQs</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">1. Why book Atlas Aircon for Air Handling Unit services Kheda?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer specialized local expertise with a focus on industrial uptime. Our technicians are trained to handle heavy-duty AHUs common in Kheda&#8217;s industrial zones.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">2. Do you provide AHU AMC in Nadiad?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide both Comprehensive and Non-Comprehensive Annual Maintenance Contracts for all commercial and industrial units in Nadiad.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">3. How often should an industrial AHU be serviced?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">In industrial areas like Matar or Kheda GIDC, we recommend monthly filter checks and a deep service every 3-4 months due to higher dust levels.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">4. Can you repair AHU motors on-site?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Basic maintenance and bearing changes are done on-site. For major rewinding, we use our specialized workshop facilities for high-precision work.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">5. Do you handle cleanroom AHUs for pharmaceutical units?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we specialize in hygienic AHU maintenance, HEPA filter validation, and validation of sterile environments for pharma industries.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">6. What is the turnaround time for a breakdown in Kheda?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We aim to reach industrial sites in Kheda district within 4-8 hours of a breakdown call for priority clients.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">7. Are spare parts for older AHU models available?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We maintain an extensive inventory of universal spares that fit most older AHU brands, ensuring quick restoration.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">8. Can regular servicing reduce my factory&#8217;s electricity bill?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes. Clean coils and properly balanced fan motors reduce the energy consumption of the HVAC system by up to 25%.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">9. Do you cover Matar and Mehmedabad locations?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, Atlas Aircon provides complete coverage across the entire Kheda district, including Matar, Mehmedabad, and Kathlal.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">10. How can I get a custom service quote?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Call us at +91 97272 57141 or message us on WhatsApp with your AHU capacity and location details for a free audit.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREAS SERVED LIST -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white border-t\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">Service Presence Across Kheda District</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed overflow-y-auto max-h-40 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                Nadiad | Kheda | Mehmedabad | Matar | Dakor | Kapadvanj | Thasra | Vaso | Galteshwar | Mahudha | Kathlal | Nadiad GIDC | Matar Industrial Area | Kheda Industrial Estate | Mehmedabad Clusters | Vaso Processing Belt | Galteshwar Area | Kathlal Hub | Dakor Road | Thasra Engineering Zone.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-12\">\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon\" class=\"h-10 mb-6 brightness-0 invert\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">Your trusted industrial HVAC partners providing <b>Air Handling Unit services Kheda</b> for over 15 years. Quality and reliability guaranteed.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-4\">Quick Links</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                    <li><a href=\"/ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Industrial AC Service</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">HVAC Solutions</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Chiller Maintenance</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Duct Cleaning</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-4\">Industrial Hubs</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                    <li><a href=\"/locations\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Nadiad GIDC</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/locations\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Matar Industrial</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/locations\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Kheda Estate</a